=== briefing intro_s
Get to know the Master Sukro
#show Hero
#show Sukro
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Sukro 1
Greetings. I am Master Sukro, an excellent blacksmith. It's always good to see new faces in our town, especially those willing to lend a hand in these difficult times.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero 2
And I greet you, noble blacksmith. I hope you will do something for me as well?
#phrase Sukro 3
Of course. But since you're not in Hadagan's service under Lord Firez, I'll be selling my craft. The results, however, won't disappoint you!

